{"name":"Adept","hex":"#293947","fetched":"2026-10-19","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"adept","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Well skilled; completely versed; thoroughly proficient."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["One fully skilled or well versed in anything; a proficient"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/adept"}],"entries":[{"title":"Adept","blocks":[{"text":"An adept is an individual identified as having attained a specific level of knowledge, skill, or aptitude in doctrines relevant to a particular occult discipline, such as alchemy or magic."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/The_Immortal_Soul_of_the_Taoist_Adept.PNG/330px-The_Immortal_Soul_of_the_Taoist_Adept.PNG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adept","wikidata":"Q356336"},{"title":"Adept (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Adept is a Swedish metalcore band from Trosa. Formed in 2004, the band currently consists of vocalist Robert Ljung, guitarists Gustav Lithammer and Kasper Larcombe-Tronstad, bassist Filip Brandelius and drummer Gabriel Hellmark. Adept have released three EPs and four studio albums to date, including Another Year of Disaster in 2009, Death Dealers in 2011, Silence the World in 2013, and Sleepless in 2016. After pausing band activities at the onset of the COVID-19 pandemic, Adept returned to the stage in November 2024 for a 20th anniversary show at Corefest in Stuttgart, Germany. In 2025, Adept released their fifth studio album, Blood Covenant."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Bravalla-59.jpg/330px-Bravalla-59.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adept_(band)","wikidata":"Q356329"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/The_Immortal_Soul_of_the_Taoist_Adept.PNG/500px-The_Immortal_Soul_of_the_Taoist_Adept.PNG?utm